  "description": "A .NET 10 port of Scrapy: spiders, CSS/XPath selectors, items and item loaders, pipelines, feed exports (JSON, JSON Lines, CSV, XML), downloader and spider middlewares, retry, redirects, cookies, proxies, robots.txt, HTTP cache, AutoThrottle, duplicate filtering, pause/resume with a crash-safe disk queue, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3, spider contracts (scrapynet check), source-generated item accessors for NativeAOT, signals, stats and a Scrapy-style command line. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
